stion 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nTo celebrate moving into his new house, Zhongli hosted a housewarming party and invited one of his best friends, Ollie. Around 6 p.m., Ollie arrived at Zhongli's house and entered without taking off his shoes. Seeing this, Zhongli told him to take off his shoes and offered a pair of slippers to use inside the house.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Zhongli ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Hopeful & Curiosity\nB) Annoyance & Joy\nC) Annoyance & Gratitude\nD) Disapproval & Annoyance\nE) Disapproval & Hopeful\nF) Joy & Curiosity\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Zhongli feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) Ollie didn't bring a housewarming gift & Ollie asked for a housewarming gift\nB) Ollie asked for a housewarming gift & He wanted to wear Ollie's shoes\nC) Ollie didn't take off his shoes when entering his house, which is uncommon in his culture & Ollie refused to change his shoes despite his offer\nD) Ollie wore his slippers & Ollie showed up at his house unannounced\nE) Ollie didn't take off his shoes when entering his house, which is uncommon in his culture & Ollie asked for a housewarming gift\nF) Ollie didn't take off his shoes when entering his house, which is uncommon in his culture & Ollie arrived late to the housewarming party","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012431649298169402,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0a99aa9dc5a833d8c01","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482345877,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:05","delFlag":0,"emotio